---
title: "Free Tool to Redact Screen Recordings and Demos"
description: "Hide emails, API keys, passwords, names and faces in a screen recording or product demo. Runs in your browser, so your video is never uploaded."
---

<section class="tool-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <%= partial "partials/brand" %>
    <h1>Screencast Redactor</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Drop in a screen recording, such as a product demo. The tool reads the screen as it changes and hides emails, API keys, passwords, names and faces.
      Your video is never uploaded.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="tool">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="model-bar" id="model" data-state="off">
      <div class="model-text">
        <strong>AI</strong>
        <span class="status" id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite">AI models download once when you open a video.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="model-actions">
        <select id="ocr-lang" aria-label="Text language"></select>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="drop" id="drop">
      <p class="drop-title">Drop a screen recording here</p>
      <p class="drop-text">or choose a file. MP4, MOV or WebM, up to 10 minutes.</p>
      <div class="drop-actions">
        <label class="button">
          Choose a video
          <input type="file" id="file" accept="video/*,.mp4,.mov,.m4v,.webm,.mkv" class="visually-hidden">
        </label>
        <button type="button" id="sample" class="button button-outline">Try an example video</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="editor" id="editor" hidden>
      <div class="controls">
        <div class="control">
          <span class="control-label">Hide</span>
          <div class="chips" id="categories"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="control-row">
          <div class="control">
            <span class="control-label">Style</span>
            <div class="chips" id="style">
              <button type="button" class="chip" data-value="box" aria-pressed="true">Black box</button>
              <button type="button" class="chip" data-value="blur" aria-pressed="false">Blur</button>
              <button type="button" class="chip" data-value="pixelate" aria-pressed="false">Pixelate</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <label class="control" id="strength-control" hidden>
            <span class="control-label">Strength</span>
            <input type="range" id="strength" min="1" max="10" value="8">
          </label>
          <label class="control grow">
            <span class="control-label">Always hide these words</span>
            <input type="text" id="custom" placeholder="Customer names, project names, hosts" autocomplete="off">
          </label>
          <label class="control checkbox">
            <span class="control-label">Sound</span>
            <span><input type="checkbox" id="keep-audio" checked> Keep audio</span>
          </label>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="stage">
        <canvas id="canvas" aria-label="Video preview with private details hidden"></canvas>
        <div class="boxes" id="boxes"></div>
        <video id="video" playsinline preload="auto" hidden></video>
      </div>

      <div class="editor-foot">
        <div class="player">
          <button type="button" id="play" class="button button-outline">Play</button>
          <input type="range" id="scrubber" min="0" max="1" step="0.01" value="0" aria-label="Position in video">
          <span id="time" class="time">0:00 / 0:00</span>
        </div>
        <div class="editor-actions">
          <button type="button" id="new" class="button button-outline">Use another video</button>
          <button type="button" id="original" class="button button-outline">Hold to see original</button>
          <button type="button" id="download" class="button" disabled>Download video</button>
        </div>
        <p class="download-note" id="download-note" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
      </div>

      <div class="control">
        <span class="control-label">Found</span>
        <div class="people" id="items" data-empty="Items show here after the scan."></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="notes">
      <div>
        <h3>What it covers</h3>
        <p>Emails, phone numbers, names, links, @usernames, IP addresses, card and bank numbers, ID numbers, API keys, tokens, passwords and faces, such as a webcam in the corner.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Check before you share</h3>
        <p>Text reading can miss small, faint or fast-moving text. Play the preview to the end. Click an item to show it, and drag on the video to hide an area for the whole video.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Private by design</h3>
        <p>The page has no server code. <a href="https://github.com/naptha/tesseract.js" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Tesseract.js</a> reads the screen, <a href="https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo/tree/main/models/face_detection_yunet" target="_blank" rel="noopener">YuNet</a> finds faces and <a href="https://mediabunny.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Mediabunny</a> makes the video, all on your device.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script type="module" src="/javascripts/tools/screencast-redactor.js"></script>
